sequenceDiagram
    participant P as itu-t-documents
    participant W as www.itu.int
    participant A as auth.itu.int
    participant L as login.itu.int
    P->>W: GET a protected document
    W-->>P: 302 to F5Networks-SSO-Req
    P->>A: GET the SSO request
    A-->>P: page with the SAMLRequest
    Note over P,A: the four posts of the handshake
    P->>L: POST the SAMLRequest
    L-->>P: logon page
    P->>L: POST user name and password
    L-->>P: page that submits itself with a dummy value
    P->>L: POST the dummy value back
    L-->>P: page with the SAMLResponse
    P->>A: POST the SAMLResponse to the ACS
    A-->>P: 302 to www.itu.int/F5Networks-SSO-Resp
    P->>W: GET F5Networks-SSO-Resp
    W-->>P: sets the session cookie, redirects
    P->>W: GET the document
